cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ringity in your work, please cite (any of) the metadata below."
type: software
title: ringity
abstract: >-
  ringity is a Python package for quantifying ring structure in data via
  persistent homology. It computes ring scores for networks and point clouds.
version: 0.5a1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.4908926
date-released: 2026-10-19
